      "side": 1,
      "message": "`leanMarkdownConfig` inherits host `markdown.frontmatter`, `markdown.multicolumn`, and `markdown.blocknote` settings through `new Config(base)`. On hosts where those extensions are enabled, `YamlFrontMatterBlock` and overflowing `MultiColumnBlock.Column` blocks (`span \u003d\u003d 0`) are silently dropped from rendered HTML (hiding docstring content), and nested `BlockNote` containers bypass `exceedsMarkdownNestingLimit`. Please force `frontmatter`, `multicolumn`, and `blocknote` to `false` here alongside `toc` and `safehtml`.",
